  "findings": [
    {
      "id": "f1",
      "severity": "major",
      "disposition": "fixed",
      "reason": "Compacting the review entry removed seven existing SOP evidence markers. Actual compact evidence fields restored in 9a918fa; no tests or gates weakened. Final bound suite is 102/102 and independent final two exported-method checks are 2/2."
    },
    {
      "id": "f2",
      "severity": "minor",
      "disposition": "fixed",
      "reason": "Retry-After language could be read as extending an expired operation deadline. Final source explicitly ends the current operation first; business deferral does not revive its expired budget."
    },
    {
      "id": "f3",
      "severity": "minor",
      "disposition": "fixed",
      "reason": "Old flaky workflow wording prescribed isolation unconditionally. Final source makes isolation conditional, requires boundary validation, and preserves the original failure state."
    },
    {
      "id": "f4",
      "severity": "minor",
      "disposition": "fixed",
      "reason": "T2 task row described the older green-index-refresh receipt as the final source binding. Final tasks row distinguishes the historical 27-method receipt from the later SOP fix and latest full receipt; hash included in the 72-input index."
    },
    {
      "id": "f5",
      "severity": "minor",
      "disposition": "fixed",
      "reason": "Review findings referenced nonexistent general/red.json. Final wrapper references the actual general/results.json and separate general-implementation/red.json; hash included in the 72-input index."
    }
  ],
  "limitations": [
    "Source approval does not assert completed platform, merge or release readiness.",
    "Five CMake/CTest cases were skipped locally; the refusal experiment is not real CI execution.",
    "No ARM cross-compilation, board/emulator/device actions, Valgrind profiling or hardware performance qualification occurred.",
    "No model or native agent-host task execution, blind A/B, task success-rate, provider-token or cost improvement was measured.",
    "The independent reviewer did not rerun the full suite; the integrator's exact final-source receipt was independently verified.",
    "Native ADC checks establish the declared integer-domain behavior and local compiler execution, not every compiler/target's qualification.",
    "Historical early reviews and green-named receipts retain their own source identities and failures; current approval binds only the specified final head and input index.",
    "The 65 registered Skills are not all rewritten or newly behaviorally evaluated in this change; the complete diff covers seven existing Skills plus the ADC example and supporting contracts.",
    "Prior 11.3.5 remote publication is integrator-provided evidence; this reviewer did not independently query those remote platform objects.",
    "This typed record mechanically projects the original source verdict at its original review time. The two readable report copies each remove exactly one final LF; all original report bytes and the historical attempt1 patch are retained in packaging-original-bytes.json. The unchanged 72-input index resolves as 71 original files plus one decoded patch. Later packaging verification is separate from that source verdict; it does not redate or expand source approval."
